  "title": "Polymath Robotics Blog | Leveraging LLMs to integrate autonomy into Robots",
  "summary": "At Polymath, we try to find bottlenecks in our engineering process and find creative ways to solve them. In general we are skeptical of AI solutions. We have heard of solutions that claim to \"build a robot.\" But building robots is not as easy as some of the AI hype claims. The real question for us is, \"what areas can AI be helpful to robotics?\"",
